    <string name="accessibility_disclosure">Pauca uses the accessibility service for only two things: locking the screen with a double tap and, in focus mode, going back home when an app outside the list opens. It doesn\'t read screen content, and collects or shares no data.\n\nTurn on Pauca in your phone\'s accessibility settings.</string>
    <string name="accessibility_service_description">Locks the screen with a double tap and, in focus mode, pauses apps that aren\'t on your list. Pauca doesn\'t collect or share data.</string>
    <string name="admin_permission_message">Pauca uses this permission only to lock the screen with a double tap. No data is collected.</string>

