    <string name="full_title">Available in Pauca</string>
    <string name="full_message">Pauca Lite is the free version. Pauca, the full version, adds focus mode, unlimited profiles, more themes and colors (your own wallpaper too), fonts and alignment, and buttons you can hide. It\'s a one-time purchase, with no subscription and, like this one, no internet access.\n\nYour cards and settings come with you.</string>
